      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY FAIRY BREAD (4) latest effort finished 4th on October 9 over 498m at Townsville behind Footloose beaten 16 lengths (29.54) in a Restricted WIN. Looks hard to beat with even luck. ROY LEARY (5) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish 5.5 lengths away in third (31.11) at this track in a Grade 5 over 527m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Can feature again. MR. TURBO (8) has been out of the placings the last couple but was a Maiden winner (19.67) three back at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. ZIPPING DONOVAN (1) cannot be ruled out.",
